the poor lame man do?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l008","ordinal":141398,"en":"His white beard had thinned;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l009","ordinal":141399,"en":"Tears flowing from both eyes"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l010","ordinal":141400,"en":"Poured down past his collarbones."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l011","ordinal":141401,"en":"Bolokbay came to greet her:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l012","ordinal":141402,"en":"“My dear Kanykey,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l013","ordinal":141403,"en":"Queen of the khan, my foal!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l014","ordinal":141404,"en":"To Temir Khan's city,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l015","ordinal":141405,"en":"Were you the one who would wander away?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l016","ordinal":141406,"en":"To the mountain of Kaiypchy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l017","ordinal":141407,"en":"Distracted, finding no support,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l018","ordinal":141408,"en":"Was I the one who would flee?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l019","ordinal":141409,"en":"Is this God's Night of Power,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l020","ordinal":141410,"en":"Bringing joy to this ill-fated soul?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l021","ordinal":141411,"en":"Is this the day the queen arrives?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l022","ordinal":141412,"en":"While I lived in Kaiypchy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l023","ordinal":141413,"en":"Long I lived in desolation."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l024","ordinal":141414,"en":"Royal queen, unfortunate one,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l025","ordinal":141415,"en":"I thought I would see you only in death!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l026","ordinal":141416,"en":"Is it Kanykey herself?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l027","ordinal":141417,"en":"Has she come here alive?”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l028","ordinal":141418,"en":"Bolokbay and the forty guards"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l029","ordinal":141419,"en":"Came weeping, saying this."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l030","ordinal":141420,"en":"Before much time had passed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l031","ordinal":141421,"en":"Let us leave that aside,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l032","ordinal":141422,"en":"And begin with this other part."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l033","ordinal":141423,"en":"To Sultan Manas, the warrior,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l034","ordinal":141424,"en":"Surging with valor,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l035","ordinal":141425,"en":"He met him at thirty-four years of age."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l036","ordinal":141426,"en":"A star was stirred in the heavens;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l037","ordinal":141427,"en":"With Manas, becoming friends twelve times,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l038","ordinal":141428,"en":"They fought the enemy together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b003:l039","ordinal":141429,"en":"Wrought slaughter together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l001","ordinal":141430,"en":"Stood together in times of excitement."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l002","ordinal":141431,"en":"They scouted together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l003","ordinal":141432,"en":"Raised strife together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l005","ordinal":141433,"en":"Went to face death together,","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l006","ordinal":141434,"en":"Known as Manas and Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l007","ordinal":141435,"en":"The two astonished the world."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l008","ordinal":141436,"en":"The rulers of so many people"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l009","ordinal":141437,"en":"Wrought slaughter among the Chinese."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l010","ordinal":141438,"en":"With leopard Manas, the lion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l011","ordinal":141439,"en":"Sharing their gains in life,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l012","ordinal":141440,"en":"Sharing their faith in death."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l013","ordinal":141441,"en":"His boundless valor surging,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l014","ordinal":141442,"en":"To King Manas, the sultan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l015","ordinal":141443,"en":"He came as a protector."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l016","ordinal":141444,"en":"Renowned Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l017","ordinal":141445,"en":"He built up into a house,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l018","ordinal":141446,"en":"He planted into a garden."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l019","ordinal":141447,"en":"Renowned Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l020","ordinal":141448,"en":"He made a formidable khan of weight."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l021","ordinal":141449,"en":"His uncle, old Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l022","ordinal":141450,"en":"Was a sage of surpassing knowledge."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l023","ordinal":141451,"en":"His uncle Bakai, a boundless hero,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l024","ordinal":141452,"en":"Than Manas, gone to the other world,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l025","ordinal":141453,"en":"Was a lion greater in knowledge."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l026","ordinal":141454,"en":"Finding solutions beyond all others,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l027","ordinal":141455,"en":"Lion Bakai, the wise man."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l028","ordinal":141456,"en":"If you ask of the wolf-maned one's state,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l029","ordinal":141457,"en":"He wore a blue lynx-fur cap,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l030","ordinal":141458,"en":"Brandished a blue-mottled shield,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l033","ordinal":141459,"en":"Bakai Khan, the son of Bai,","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l034","ordinal":141460,"en":"Rinsed his mouth with honey."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l035","ordinal":141461,"en":"He found words at an unexpected moment,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l036","ordinal":141462,"en":"Found eyes in the dark."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l037","ordinal":141463,"en":"He would not be entangled in wicked words;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l038","ordinal":141464,"en":"In the dark, upon a corsac fox's"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0852:b004:l039","ordinal":141465,"en":"Trail, he would never lose his way."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l001","ordinal":141466,"en":"Set at the head, he brought good fortune,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l002","ordinal":141467,"en":"Watch him: he was worth a countless army."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l003","ordinal":141468,"en":"The lion, elder Bakai—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l004","ordinal":141469,"en":"In this world the one God"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l005","ordinal":141470,"en":"Had made him a true holy sage."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l006","ordinal":141471,"en":"When dear Manas died,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l007","ordinal":141472,"en":"After he had passed away,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l008","ordinal":141473,"en":"For Semetey and Kanykei,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l009","ordinal":141474,"en":"For the sake of those two,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l010","ordinal":141475,"en":"At Bek-Zhayloo, at the head of Besh-Tash,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l011","ordinal":141476,"en":"With five hundred households under him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l012","ordinal":141477,"en":"He settled in hiding;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l013","ordinal":141478,"en":"Against the six villains, Bakai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l014","ordinal":141479,"en":"Fought for twelve years."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l015","ordinal":141480,"en":"When Manas died,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l016","ordinal":141481,"en":"He gave up his lordship,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l017","ordinal":141482,"en":"Herding camels, tending livestock,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l018","ordinal":141483,"en":"He took up this way of life;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l019","ordinal":141484,"en":"When his lord Manas died,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l020","ordinal":141485,"en":"He turned toward a life of hardship."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l021","ordinal":141486,"en":"Stirred by the sight of the royal camp,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l022","ordinal":141487,"en":"With five hundred households under him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l023","ordinal":141488,"en":"Argyn and Kyrgyz together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l024","ordinal":141489,"en":"He too came with them all."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l025","ordinal":141490,"en":"Meeting Kanykei,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l026","ordinal":141491,"en":"Your dear uncle Bakai's"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l027","ordinal":141492,"en":"Stature and dignity,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l028","ordinal":141493,"en":"His bearing on horseback,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l029","ordinal":141494,"en":"Seemed all the finer."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l030","ordinal":141495,"en":"Shining at the head of the migration,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l031","ordinal":141496,"en":"Calling like a migrating goose,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l032","ordinal":141497,"en":"Making ready with Kokcholok,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l033","ordinal":141498,"en":"Springing like a blue tiger,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l034","ordinal":141499,"en":"Had you seen him then,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l035","ordinal":141500,"en":"Praying to the one God,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l036","ordinal":141501,"en":"Lord Bakai was coming."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l037","ordinal":141502,"en":"Kanykei, whose child had returned,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l038","ordinal":141503,"en":"When she saw Khan Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b003:l039","ordinal":141504,"en":"Spoke no word, said nothing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l001","ordinal":141505,"en":"Poor Kanykei—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l002","ordinal":141506,"en":"Did you see how modest she was?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l003","ordinal":141507,"en":"Her voice had reached God;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l004","ordinal":141508,"en":"Unable to look Bakai in the face,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l005","ordinal":141509,"en":"She covered her eyes and fell."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l006","ordinal":141510,"en":"While Kanykei was like this,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l007","ordinal":141511,"en":"Grandmother Chyiyrdy"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l008","ordinal":141512,"en":"Came out to welcome Bakai."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l009","ordinal":141513,"en":"When he saw Chyiyrdy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l010","ordinal":141514,"en":"The hero, elder Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l011","ordinal":141515,"en":"Wept and wept in anguish,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l012","ordinal":141516,"en":"Pleading with Chyiyrdy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l013","ordinal":141517,"en":"When he saw Chyiyrdy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l014","ordinal":141518,"en":"His heart was sorely troubled;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l015","ordinal":141519,"en":"Your uncle, elder Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l016","ordinal":141520,"en":"With tears pouring from his eyes:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l017","ordinal":141521,"en":"“Elder of ninety-five,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l018","ordinal":141522,"en":"Holy sage as great as a mountain!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l019","ordinal":141523,"en":"You bore a lion among sons,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l020","ordinal":141524,"en":"You bore a lion among daughters,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l021","ordinal":141525,"en":"My noble, venerable mother,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l022","ordinal":141526,"en":"My holy sage with a golden womb!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l023","ordinal":141527,"en":"Until he reached twelve years of age,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l024","ordinal":141528,"en":"I lived by herding camels—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l025","ordinal":141529,"en":"Was this conduct of mine bad?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l026","ordinal":141530,"en":"To Temir Khan's city"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l027","ordinal":141531,"en":"You wandered, then returned;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l028","ordinal":141532,"en":"My mother, my ocean, are you well?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l029","ordinal":141533,"en":"A member of a royal household,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l030","ordinal":141534,"en":"Mother, should you have to live in flight?!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l031","ordinal":141535,"en":"You turned your heart toward righteousness,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l032","ordinal":141536,"en":"You have found your way back"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l033","ordinal":141537,"en":"To your own land of Talas!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l034","ordinal":141538,"en":"Zhylgyndy, Keng-Kol, broad Talas—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l035","ordinal":141539,"en":"You have seen your plain, mother!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l036","ordinal":141540,"en":"The great pauper who herded camels—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l037","ordinal":141541,"en":"You have seen your child, mother!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l038","ordinal":141542,"en":"The broad royal camp left by your child Manas—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0853:b004:l039","ordinal":141543,"en":"You have seen your town, mother!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l001","ordinal":141544,"en":"Poor elder Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l002","ordinal":141545,"en":"His voice reaching God,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l003","ordinal":141546,"en":"From Kokcholok's back"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l004","ordinal":141547,"en":"Bakai swayed and fell."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l005","ordinal":141548,"en":"Khan Bakai laid his head"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l006","ordinal":141549,"en":"Upon Chyiyrdy's breast,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l007","ordinal":141550,"en":"Taking in the scent of her breast,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l008","ordinal":141551,"en":"Saying, “Oh, my mother,” as he did so."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l009","ordinal":141552,"en":"Like clouds in the sky,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l010","ordinal":141553,"en":"Here they caressed one another;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l011","ordinal":141554,"en":"The poor souls who had wandered"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l012","ordinal":141555,"en":"Were reunited here!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l013","ordinal":141556,"en":"The orphan and the widow—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l014","ordinal":141557,"en":"When Bakai arrived and saw them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l015","ordinal":141558,"en":"Your old uncle Bakai wept,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l016","ordinal":141559,"en":"All the Argyn and Kyrgyz wept."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l017","ordinal":141560,"en":"Burulcha, Esen Khan's daughter,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l018","ordinal":141561,"en":"Birmyskal, Ay Zhang-Zhung's daughter,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l019","ordinal":141562,"en":"Both widows wept together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l020","ordinal":141563,"en":"Looking at them as they sat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l021","ordinal":141564,"en":"Weeping bitterly in their sorrow."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l022","ordinal":141565,"en":"The orphans left by the heroes—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l023","ordinal":141566,"en":"One was Almambet's Kulchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l024","ordinal":141567,"en":"The other, Khan Chubak's Kanchoro—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0854:b003:l025","ordinal":141568,"en":"The two came into view;"}]
